{"step_index":2441,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T22:01:29Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Fixed React object reference mutation, added optimistic state rendering, and added prominent DNC Alert card to Educator Profile.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Walkthrough: DNC State Reactivity & Visual Alert Banner\\n\\n## 1. Root Cause Analysis\\n- **React State Object Reference:** In `WebDatabase`, `getLeadById` returned the same in-memory object reference. Because React performs shallow equality checks (`l === prevLead`), calling `setLead(l)` did not immediately trigger a component re-render until refreshed.\\n- **SQL Parameter Shift:** When `email` was added to `handleSaveEdit`, the SQL parameter count shifted in `WebDatabase.runAsync`.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. Solutions Implemented\\n- **Optimistic State Reactivity ([`src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx)):**\\n  - Added immediate optimistic state updates: `setLead((prev) => prev ? { ...prev, last_disposition: 'do_not_call' } : null)`.\\n  - Added object-cloning `setLead({ ...l })` on database reloads to guarantee React re-renders instantaneously.\\n- **High-Visibility DNC Warning Card ([`src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx)):**\\n  - When an educator is flagged as DNC, a prominent red alert card is rendered right in the profile header:\\n    `🛡️ DO NOT CALL (DNC COMPLIANCE): This educator has requested not to be called. They have been permanently removed from all active dialing queues.`\\n- **Emerald Reinstate Action Button ([`src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx)):**\\n  - Tapping **`🔄 Reinstate`** immediately un-flags the lead, changes their status back to `READY TO CALL`, and restores them to the active Power Dialing queue with zero delay.\\n- **Web Database Parameter Mapping ([`src/db/database.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/database.ts)):**\\n  - Fixed SQL parameter index alignment in `WebDatabase.runAsync` for `UPDATE leads`.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Live Production Deployment\\n👉 **[https://valuteachers-d\n<truncated 58 bytes>","Description":"\"Update walkthrough with DNC state reactivity fixes\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\brorm\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing walkthrough.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
